
<& "/page/page_title.mas", title => "SGN 常見問題(SGN: Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ))" &>
<table summary="" width="720" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
  border="0">
    <tr>
      <td>
        <center>
          <table summary="" width="720" cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0" border="0">
            <tr>
              <td>
                本頁包含 SGN 使用者提出的常見問題，對廣大的 SGN 使用者社群具有參考價值。如果您有認為應補充的問題，請<a href="/contact/form">與我們聯繫(let us know)</a>。(This page contains questions that SGN users ask and are useful to the larger SGN user community. Please <a href="/contact/form">let us know</a> if you have a question that you think should be added.)

                <p><strong>問題(Question):</strong> 我在哪裡可以訂購選殖株？(Where can I order clones?)<br />
                <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> 這取決於物種和特定的基因庫。對於番茄選殖株，您可以使用 <a href="http://ted.bti.cornell.edu/order/">Boyce Thompson 研究所(Boyce Thompson Institute)</a> 的選殖株訂購設施。對於作為美國番茄基因體計畫一部分進行定序的馬鈴薯選殖株，訂購由 <a href="http://genome.arizona.edu/orders/">亞利桑那基因體研究所(Arizona Genome Institute)</a> 處理。對於所有其他基因庫，請聯絡基因庫詳細資訊頁面上列出的基因庫提交者（使用<a href="/search/direct_search.pl?search=ESTs">基因庫搜尋(Library Search)</a>頁面尋找相關基因庫）。(This depends on the species and on the specific library. For tomato clones, you can use the clone ordering facility at the <a href="http://ted.bti.cornell.edu/order/">Boyce Thompson Institute</a>. For potato clones that were sequenced as part of the U.S. potato genome project, the ordering is handled by the <a href="http://genome.arizona.edu/orders/">Arizona Genome Institute</a>. For all other libraries, please contact the library submitters given on the library detail pages (use the <a href="/search/direct_search.pl?search=ESTs">Library Search</a> page to find the library in question).)</p>

                <p><strong>問題(Question):</strong> SGN 頁面在我的瀏覽器上看起來非常混亂。(The SGN pages look really messed up on my browser.)<br />
                <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> 您使用的瀏覽器版本較舊且不支援樣式表，例如 Netscape 4.x 系列的瀏覽器。SGN 頁面需要開啟樣式表 (CSS) 與 JavaScript 功能。(You are working with an old browser that does not support style sheets, such as the browsers of the Netscape 4.x series. SGN pages require style sheets and javascript to be turned on.)</p>

                <p><strong>問題(Question):</strong> 我可以向 SGN 提交我的資料嗎？(Can I submit my data to SGN?)<br />
                <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> 請使用<a href="/contact/form">聯絡表單(contact form)</a>向我們發送訊息，附上您想要提交的資料說明。隨後我們將與您合作，將您的資料整合至資料庫中，和/或新增至 FTP 伺服器。(Please send us a message using the <a href="/contact/form">contact form</a> with a description of the data you would like to submit. We will then work with you to integrate your data into the database and/or add it to the FTP server.)<br />
                </p>
                <p><strong>問題(Question):</strong> 番茄基因體有 12 條染色體。然而，某些序列被比對至「ch00」。什麼是「ch00」？(Tomato genome has 12 chromosomes. However, some sequences are mapped to 'ch00'. What is 'ch00'?) <br />
                <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> ch00 是一個佔位符號，代表無法比對至 12 條番茄染色體中任何一條的番茄序列。(ch00 is a place holder for tomato sequences that could not be mapped to any of the 12 tomato chromosomes.)
                <br />
                <p><strong>問題(Question):</strong> Gbrowse 軌道中的顏色漸層代表什麼意思？(What does the color gradient in the Gbrowse tracks mean?) <br />
                <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> 顏色的深淺表示特徵與基因體序列之間的匹配程度，白色表示最低匹配度，而最深的顏色表示最強匹配度。您可以點擊感興趣軌道上的「?」按鈕找到更詳細的說明。(The intensity of the color signifies the degree of match between the feature and the genome sequence, the white color signifies the lowest match whereas the darkest color signifies the strongest match. You can find more detailed explanation by following the '?' button on the track of your interest.)

		<p>
		  <strong>問題(Question):</strong> 格式為 Solyc01g001010.1.1 的識別碼是什麼意思？(What do the identifiers of the format Solyc01g001010.1.1 mean?)<br />
		  <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> 這些識別碼表示來自番茄基因體定序計畫的基因座 (Loci)、預測 mRNA 與蛋白質序列。「Solyc」是<i>番茄 (Solanum lycopersicum)</i> 的 5 個字母縮寫，「Solyc」後面的 2 位數字表示染色體編號，「g」表示該序列是基因 (gene)，「g」後面的 6 位數字表示染色體上的基因，從頂部開始並以 10 為增量計數。第一個「.1」表示基因座的註釋版本號（若僅給出第一個數字，則表示基因座），而第二個「.1」表示轉錄本（一個基因座可以產生多個轉錄本、剪接變異體）以及衍生自這些轉錄本的蛋白質。(These identifiers denote loci, predicted mRNA and protein sequences from the tomato genome sequencing project. "Solyc" is the 5 letter abbreviation of <i>Solanum lycopersicum</i>, the 2 digit number following the 'Solyc' denotes the chromosome, 'g' denotes that the sequence is a gene, and the 6 digit number following the 'g' identifies the gene on the chromosome, starting at the top and counting in 10 increments. The first '.1' denotes the annotation version number of the locus (and if only the first number is given, denotes the locus), whereas the second '.1' denotes the transcript (a locus can give rise to many transcripts, splice variants), and also the proteins derived from these transcripts.)
                <br />
                </p>
                <p>
		  <strong>問題(Question):</strong> 我該如何針對批次序列使用 SGN 內含子尋找工具 (Intron Finder)？(How can I use the SGN Intron Finder tool for a batch of sequences?)<br />
		  <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> (1) 您可以在<a href="/tools/intron_detection/find_introns.pl">表單(form)</a>中輸入多個序列。(2) 如果您是在本地端執行 BLAST，請嘗試使用以下程式碼：<br/> <a href="https://github.com/solgenomics/sgn/blob/master/cgi-bin/tools/intron_detection/intron_finder_homology.pl">程式碼 1(code 1)</a>, <a href="https://github.com/solgenomics/sgn/blob/master/lib/SGN/IntronFinder/Homology.pm">程式碼 2(code 2)</a>。((1) You can enter multiple sequences to the <a href="/tools/intron_detection/find_introns.pl">form</a>. (2) If you are doing the blasting locally, try using the code below:<br/> <a href="https://github.com/solgenomics/sgn/blob/master/cgi-bin/tools/intron_detection/intron_finder_homology.pl"> code 1</a>, <a href="https://github.com/solgenomics/sgn/blob/master/lib/SGN/IntronFinder/Homology.pm">code 2</a>.) 
                <br />
                </p>
                <p>
		  <strong>問題(Question):</strong> 國際番茄基因體定序計畫使用了哪一個栽培品種？(What cultivar was used for the international tomato genome sequencing project ?)<br />
		  <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> <a href="/stock/676/view">Heinz 1706</a>。
                <br />
                </p>
                 <p>
		  <strong>問題(Question):</strong> 我該如何下載番茄基因體上的註釋特徵？(How can I download annotation features on the tomato genome?)<br />
		  <strong>回答(Answer):</strong> 作為 Gbrowse 下載功能的替代方案，您可以使用此<a href="/search/features">工具(tool)</a>選擇感興趣的區域，並使用頁面右上角的下載選項下載這些特徵。(As an alternative to Gbrowse's download function, you can use this <a href="/search/features">tool</a> to select your region of interest and download the features using the download options at the top right of the page.) 
                <br />
                </p>
                <p>
		  <strong>問題(Question):</strong> 我該如何在不同的組裝版本 (builds) 之間轉換番茄 unigene ID？(How can I convert tomato unigene ids between builds?)<br />
		  <strong>回答(Answer): </strong>使用此<a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/unigene_builds/combined_species_assemblies/tomato_species/tomato_species_unigenes.v1.global_versionmapping.tab">檔案(file)</a>，並閱讀此<a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/unigene_builds/combined_species_assemblies/tomato_species/README_about_global_version_mapping.txt">對照說明(key)</a>。<b>注意事項(Caveat)</b>：在不同的版本中，一個 unigene 可能會被拆分或與其他 unigene 合併。對於非番茄物種的 unigene，請在 FTP 目錄的上層尋找類似名稱的檔案。(Use this <a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/unigene_builds/combined_species_assemblies/tomato_species/tomato_species_unigenes.v1.global_versionmapping.tab">file</a>, and read this <a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/unigene_builds/combined_species_assemblies/tomato_species/README_about_global_version_mapping.txt">key</a>. <b>Caveat</b>: a unigene may be split or merged with other unigene(s) in different builds. For unigenes of non-tomato species, look for similarly named files higher up in the ftp directory.)
                <br />
                </p>
 <p>
		  <strong>問題(Question):</strong> 我該如何將番茄基因模型 ID (ITAG_2.3 註釋) 比對至其對應的 SGN unigene ID (unigene 組裝第 2 版)？(How can I map tomato gene model ids (ITAG_2.3 annotation) to their corresponding SGN unigene ids (unigine build #2)?)<br />
		  <strong>回答(Answer): </strong>使用此<a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/unigene_builds/combined_species_assemblies/tomato_species/unigene_annotations/tomato_species_unigenes.v2.Solyc_ITAG2.3.genemodels.map.txt">檔案(file)</a>，並閱讀此<a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/unigene_builds/combined_species_assemblies/tomato_species/README_about_global_version_mapping.txt">說明(note)</a>。(Use this <a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/unigene_builds/combined_species_assemblies/tomato_species/unigene_annotations/tomato_species_unigenes.v2.Solyc_ITAG2.3.genemodels.map.txt">file</a>, and read this <a href="ftp://ftp.solgenomics.net/unigene_builds/combined_species_assemblies/tomato_species/README_about_global_version_mapping.txt">note</a>.)
                <br />
                </p>
              </td>
